<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer-at-work.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>Services</nav><p class="tag">What we value</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services Across Rhode Island</h1><p class="lede">From a single estimate review to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Rhode Island Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of the loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn glass" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="pgrid"><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/appraisal-clause-advocacy/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation-table.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">01</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>We serve as your named appraiser once the appraisal provision is invoked, from the written demand to the signed award.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/homeowner-claim-valuation/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-coastal-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-coastal-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-coastal-house.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="747" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">02</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Homeowner Claim Valuation</h2><p>Independent line-item valuations for houses, condos and multi-family homes when the carrier’s estimate falls short.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/commercial-condo-hoa-claims/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/commercial-storefront.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/commercial-storefront-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/commercial-storefront.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">03</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Claims</h2><p>Appraisal and valuation for mixed-use buildings, mills, retail, offices and condominium associations.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/roof-hail-claim-valuation/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-damaged.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-damaged-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-damaged.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">04</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage</h2><p>Measured roof scopes for hail, wind and ice damage, including slate, cedar and low-slope roofs.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/wind-microburst-tornado-claims/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tree-on-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tree-on-house.webp 1022w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1022" height="575" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">05</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Wind, Microburst &amp; Tornado Damage</h2><p>Valuations for nor’easter wind, downbursts and rare tornado damage to roofs, siding, windows and trees on structures.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/hurricane-tropical-storm-claims/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-flood-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hurricane-flood-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hurricane-flood-street.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1024" height="681" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">06</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Hurricane &amp; Tropical Storm Claims</h2><p>Appraisal for hurricane and tropical storm damage, including hurricane-deductible math and wind versus flood questions.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/water-leak-sewer-backup-claims/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 683w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="683" height="455" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">07</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Water Damage &amp; Leak Claims</h2><p>Scopes for burst pipes, appliance leaks, wind-driven rain and covered backups, including drying and hidden damage.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/ice-dam-freeze-claims/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/frozen-icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/frozen-icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/frozen-icicles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">08</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Ice Dam, Snow Load &amp; Frozen Pipe Claims</h2><p>Rhode Island’s winter peril: ice dams, roof snow load and burst pipes after nor’easters and deep cold snaps.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/fire-smoke-claim-valuation/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/burned-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/burned-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/burned-house.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">09</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage</h2><p>Fire, smoke and soot valuations, from kitchen fires to total losses, including cleaning versus replacement disputes.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/claim-estimate-audit/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="601" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">10</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate, with a written summary of what’s missing, mispriced or mis-measured.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="pcard rv" href="/claim-valuation-services/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="pcard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/insurance-paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="pcard-k">11</span></span><span class="pcard-b"><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for appraisal panels, with clear process, disclosure and written decisions.</p><span class="more">Read more <svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec stone"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv"><p class="tag dark">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review gives you the answer in days, and many disputes close at that stage.</p><a class="btn ink" href="/claim-valuation-services/claim-estimate-audit/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and association claims?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes: mixed-use buildings, mills, retail, offices and condominium associations.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle flood claims?<svg class="ic chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Our appraisal work is under property policies that cover the loss. Flood policies have their own procedures; we can help organize a mixed wind and flood loss.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Carrier’s number doesn’t cover the repair?</h2><p>Send us the estimate and your photos. We’ll review them and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn ink" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ink-line" href="/request-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
